      "side": 1,
      "message": "Is this the right thing to do here? AFAICT this happens on the polling thread (which might or might not be the ConnectivityThread), right? Does that crash the app? If so, maybe that\u0027s fine since this should be super rare. It should basically \"never\" happen to regular apps outside the system, because they start after tethering, and in any case, getting a RemoteException here likely (well, not in the case of TransactionTooLargeException, but...) means that the networkstack process has crashed, which generally will already have crashed the device. Might want to add a comment to that effect.",
